     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"en-FI\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"FI\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Hi,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"FI\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">I do not think that lavaan is the right software for calculating such mediation effects. Have you looked at the Imai’s and Tingle’s work?<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"FI\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/mediation/vignettes/mediation.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/mediation/vignettes/mediation.pdf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792414627023000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2yszAsNfOThsnuxXoc2CBz\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/mediation/vignettes/mediation.pdf</span></a></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">To get started with nonlinear mediation models, you should start by clearly defining which mediation effect (natural indirect effect or something else?) you are interested\r\n in.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\">Best regards,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\">Mikko\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div></div></div></div></div>"
